cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this operator skill in your research, please cite both this repository and the accompanying preprint."
title: "APS Operator Skill: A topology-agnostic PVD operator procedure for LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  A portable, topology-agnostic operating procedure and recipe verification skill for language-model
  agents controlling physical vapor deposition (PVD) systems over the APS Control Community MCP server
  across single-chamber batch (Sputter), load-locked multi-source (ADS), and multi-chamber cluster (Cluster)
  sputtering architectures.
